/P 309 0 R
/ActualText (On this course\054 you\220ll learn to analyse real political data and build data science skills you can put on your CV\056 We\220ll start from scratch\054 so you don\220t need any experience with coding or data analysis\056 As you learn to write code in R and make data visualisations using ggplot2\054 you\220ll use your new skills to answer interesting political questions and explore how political scientists use experiments to tell cause from mere coincidence\056 Throughout the module\054 you\047ll learn how professionals use these skills at work\054 whether they work in research\054 politics\054 or industry\056 Then\054 in the final lecture\054 you\220ll have the chance to ask a guest speaker about the career paths that data science and statistics can open up once you finish your studies\056)
/K [ <<
/Type /MCR
/Pg 32 0 R
/MCID 1
>> ]
>>
endobj
